<title>USA: Lehman wins $37.15 mln Monroe County, N.Y., notes.</title>
<headline>Lehman wins $37.15 mln Monroe County, N.Y., notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $37.15 million of Monroe County, N.Y., notes.</p>
<p>The coupon was 4.25 percent and the net interest cost (NIC) was 3.67 percent. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
